**DIRAC
.TITLE
 Testing 4-component CI calculation on F atom, group C2h
.WAVE FUNCTION
#################################
**WAVE FUNCTION
.DHF
.KR CI
#########
*DHFCAL
.CLOSED SHELL
  4  0
.OPEN SHELL
 1
 5/0,6
#########
*KRCICALC
.CI PROGRAM
LUCIAREL
.INACTIVE
  1  0
.GASSH
 2
  1  3
  1  3   ! p,s
.GASSPC
  5  7
  7  7
.MK2REF
 0
.MK2DEL
 7
.CIROOTS
 7  3
.MAX CI
 20
.MXCIVE
  60
.ANALYZ
.RSTRCI
 0
#################################
*END OF


